Greetings hikers and travelers,

today there is a nice news for everyone. The new Public Beta Demo of the game has been released.

You can download it and play for the sake of exploration and be inside the first phases of Project Utgardr.
Here below the patch notes of this release.

Public Beta Demo 0.0

- World edited for the public demo. Lasting 30-60 minutes;
- New character (Thyra) implemented;
- Animations retargeted and few new ones implemented;
- Player's interactions and tutorials revisited;
- New game quality settings implemented;
- Scripts optimization and major bugs solved;
- UI changed;
- New original music implemented;

Thanks for your interest in this game. If you want you can share your feedback. Have a wonderful day.
